      "description": "Four different tactile samples: a plate of aluminum (metal), a piece of velveteen (fabric), a leaf of natural pothos (Epipremnum aureum), and a leaf of artificial pothos made of resin. Each material was held between two 10cm x 10cm square papers with a 5cm square window cut out.",
